**Table dialect is required.** A marker counts as a task **only when it is the status
cell** — the last non-empty cell of a table row. A checklist (`- [ ] task cc:todo`) is
not a table row, so the canonical counter scores it zero and the HUD, the plans-watcher
hook and the progress snapshot all report an empty plan. Earlier versions of this
template shipped the checklist form and new projects started with a blank HUD as a
result.

**Columns**: `ID` (any of `1.1`, `T001`), `Task`, `DoD`, `Depends` (`-`, `1.1`, or
`1.1, 1.2`), `Status`.

**DoD**: one verifiable line, Yes/No evaluable. "Works properly" is not a DoD.

